From: JusDots <eng@jusdots.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:53:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] JusBrowse: web rendering shell - rounded card above
 toolbar, always static

Webpage renders inside an inset rounded card (10dp margins) above the
toolbar. iterations folded in: CoordinatorLayout-safe margins, dynamic
gap, expand-when-hidden, top-mode gap fixes, PDF gap, toolbar clip.
Final: always-static shell (Gecko dynamic reserve + vertical clipping
disabled, toolbar inner padding cleared) - verified on device.
